I've seen some. Usually something not very usable like Ogresmasher.

But let's see how probable it is to have Snickersnee on the first level:

Sample of 10 games started in wizmode gave 7,5 rooms at first level.

Each room has 1/3 chance of having at least one item: 4/5 has one item, 
4/25 has two items etc. Except there is a cut-off after 100 items are 
created. This gives 1/3 item per room. That's 2,5 items on the first level.

Now for random items in the normal levels 1 item in 10 is a weapon. The 
generation of containers doesn't change that as no weapons are generated 
as content. So 1 game in 4 a random weapon is generated on the first level.

The probability of that weapon being katana is 0,4%, so 1 game in 1000 a 
katana is generated.

The probabilty of a random weapon to turn into an artifact is 1/20 so as 
there is only one artifact katana the propability of getting it on the 
first level is 1 game in 20000, which is not so unprobable.

